			"notes": "Additions:\n-Lava Java interaction: adds the 'Metallic' flavor, which lets drinkers get a taste of what wearing Batet armor would be like\n-Spellbound Enchantments interaction: Prospector can now find Batet fragments and Luss dust in the Nether, more while near Luss or Batet growths\n\nChanges:\n-Many items gained tooltips to hint at their effects\n\nBugfix:\n-Corrected worldgen crash"
